<title>USA: Ocean Optique merges with Solovision.</title>
<headline>Ocean Optique merges with Solovision.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ocean Optique Distributors Inc has successfully concluded a stock swap merger Solovision Optical Inc that gives Solovision holders a 60 percent stake in Ocean Optique.</p>
<p>In addition, two representatives of Solovision have been elected to Ocean's board of directors and three current directors remain on Ocean's board.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
